# German overrides for Plone's `widgets` domain — the JS catalog Mockup's
# patterns translate against (plone.app.content's @@plonejsi18n serves it).
#
# Only what this site renders WRONG in Plone's own catalog. pat-livesearch
# builds its summary line as `_t("found") + " " + total + " " + _t("results")`
# (mockup src/pat/livesearch/livesearch.js), and plone.app.locales translates
# BOTH halves as "gefunden", so the German panel reads "gefunden 7 gefunden".
# The two msgids are livesearch's alone in the whole of mockup, so a
# sentence-shaped pair is safe here: "Gefunden: 7 Treffer". "Treffer" is the
# same in the singular, which the pattern needs — it has no plural form and
# renders the same string for one result as for seven.
msgid ""
msgstr ""
